 have to worry about the dangers of  taking everything to their name with  them as they run to some new country  where they know nobody maybe they don't  even know the language now instead they  can store their value in a digital way  that allows for nobody to confiscate it  nobody to debase it and that i think is  just another example of why bitcoin is  inevitable
 

